      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Most endpoints require authentication, which VRChat most definitely doesn't (& won't) send along with the request. As a workaround, I built a little Udon-compatible wrapper for this a couple months ago.\n\nhttps://uds.aries.fyi/worlds/wrld_1e0e3667-af03-4ce2-9399-30014a109c48\n\nhttps://uds.aries.fyi/worlds/wrld_1e0e3667-af03-4ce2-9399-30014a109c48/cover\n\nhttps://uds.aries.fyi/groups/RELIUM.8220\n\nhttps://uds.aries.fyi/groups/RELIUM.8220/members\n\n... ect.\n\nIt's unfortunately not on the Trusted URLs list, so similar issues.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
