      "value": "@{68fc8b7f1f833c417c7b8680|full_name} Yeah, but many do, or exclude/obfuscate properties without, ie: World \"occupants\" are always 0 when unauthenticated. Interesting endpoint though, you should definitely add it to the API documentation! https://vrchat.community/contributing",
